@startuml DXGI表面共享机制
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

rectangle "交换链 (IDXGISwapChain)" as SwapChain #LightBlue {
  rectangle "后台缓冲区\n(ID3D11Texture2D)" as BackBuffer #LightYellow
}

rectangle "DXGI表面\n(IDXGISurface)" as Surface #LightGreen {
  note right
    通过GetBuffer()获取
    后台缓冲区的DXGI接口
  end note
}

rectangle "Direct3D 11" as D3D11 #LightCyan {
  rectangle "渲染目标视图\n(ID3D11RenderTargetView)" as RTV
  note bottom of RTV
    用于3D渲染
    ClearRenderTargetView()
    DrawIndexed()
  end note
}

rectangle "Direct2D" as D2D #LightPink {
  rectangle "D2D渲染目标\n(ID2D1RenderTarget)" as D2DRT
  note bottom of D2DRT
    用于2D绘制
    BeginDraw()
    DrawTextW()
    EndDraw()
  end note
}

SwapChain --> BackBuffer : 包含

BackBuffer -down-> Surface : 实现接口
BackBuffer -down-> RTV : 创建D3D视图
Surface -down-> D2DRT : 创建D2D渲染目标

note bottom of Surface
  **关键：同一个后台缓冲区**
  - 既是D3D11纹理
  - 又是DXGI表面
  - 可以同时用于D3D和D2D
end note

@enduml
